  "rules_authority": {
    "url": "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/marvel-super-heroes-release-notes",
    "rules": "The complete frozen Oracle and release notes require ordered draw then discard then a source plan counter, with recovery targets chosen only for the sacrifice-success reflexive packet. One-or-more taps observe a complete simultaneous group, not each tapped recipient. CR 603.2c and 603.10 use one occurrence and post-event characteristics; entry tapped is not becoming tapped. Convoke grouping is confirmed by the official Magic Online December 19, 2023 patch note: Deeproot Pilgrimage triggers only once when multiple creatures convoke one spell. The Rust ordered payment route therefore reserves contributors and commits the whole mana-cost tap group together; it cannot partially pay that mana cost around other clauses (CR 601.2h). No English parsing participates at runtime."
  }
